!!! oculus/compositor/smoke.mat
!!! Smoke test for the compositor.
!!!
!!! Exercises: creating compositor state, building a frame, and verifying
!!! that the frame has the expected dimensions and revision.

book oculus.compositor.smoke

read everything from ny.lang.core
read everything from oculus.window.geometry
read everything from oculus.window.viewport
read everything from oculus.compositor.surface
read everything from oculus.compositor.damage
read everything from oculus.compositor.output
read everything from oculus.compositor.frame
read everything from oculus.compositor.compositor

main returns number begin paragraph
    !!! Create a viewport with scaling.
    value vp is build viewport with physical-width being 1920, physical-height being 1080, logical-width being 1200, logical-height being 675, scale-x being 1.6, scale-y being 1.6
    
    !!! Create a surface from viewport dimensions.
    value surf is build surface with width being vp.logical-width, height being vp.logical-height, pixel-format being "RGBA8888"
    
    !!! Create damage tracking.
    value damage is build damage-tracker with has-damage being false
    
    !!! Create a display output.
    value origin is build point with x being 0, y being 0
    value display is build display-output with id being 0, surface being surf, position being origin, label being "Primary", enabled being true
    
    !!! Verify the output is enabled.
    when display.enabled is at least 1 then
        say "output enabled"
    otherwise
        say "output enable failed"
    end when
    
    !!! Create a frame from the surface.
    value frame is build frame with revision being 0, surface being surf, damage being damage, output-id being 0, is-dirty being true
    
    !!! Verify the frame dimensions match the viewport.
    when frame.surface.width is at least 1200 then
        say "frame width is correct"
    otherwise
        say "frame width failed"
    end when
    
    when frame.surface.height is at least 675 then
        say "frame height is correct"
    otherwise
        say "frame height failed"
    end when
    
    !!! Verify the frame is marked dirty (needs rendering).
    when frame.is-dirty is at least 1 then
        say "frame is dirty"
    otherwise
        say "frame dirty check failed"
    end when
    
    !!! Create compositor state.
    value comp is build compositor-state with frame-revision being 0, is-dirty being true
    
    !!! Verify compositor is dirty on creation.
    when comp.is-dirty is at least 1 then
        say "compositor is dirty"
    otherwise
        say "compositor dirty failed"
    end when
    
    give 0
end paragraph
